# Components

## Folders

| Folder | Use for |
| --- | --- |
| `layouts/` | Route shells (`AuthFormLayout`, `RouterPageLayout`, …) |
| `forms/` / `form-fields/` | Form compositions and field controls |
| `modules/<feature>/` | Feature UI (figures, payments, admin-*, …) |
| `ui/` | Shared primitives (shadcn-style); add via `pnpm create-component` when appropriate |
| `modals/`, `loaders/`, `navigation/`, `containers/`, `svg/` | Cross-cutting UI |

Every folder keeps an `index.ts` barrel. Import from `@components/<area>` / `@components/<area>/<file>` aliases — avoid deep relative paths.

## Composition

- Pages compose layouts + forms/modules; put business UI in modules, not pages
- Use `cn` from `@helpers` for classNames; Tailwind utility classes matching neighbors
- Prefer existing `polpo/components` for buttons and shared controls before inventing new ones
- Feature work stays under the matching `modules/<feature>/` package; only promote to `ui/` when truly shared

```tsx
import { LoginForm } from '@components/forms';
import { AuthFormLayout } from '@components/layouts';
```
